 ### Hosted service logs and technical information
 
-Page-fetch tool-completion logs contain the identity service, user identifier, organization or tenant identifier, tool name, URL origin and path, full valid submitted reason, outcome, and duration. This completion record omits URL query strings, fragments, and embedded URL credentials. It does not contain the returned Markdown. Search tool-completion logs contain the identity service, user identifier, tenant identifier, operation identifier, tool name, outcome, and duration; they omit the query, reason, and returned results. Pipeline-step logs contain the operation identifier, step identifier, outcome, fixed code when applicable, and duration; they omit request and result content. These omissions apply to these defined records; they are not a promise that all other systems or logs omit those fields. URL paths, queries, and reasons can contain personal or confidential information.
